WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.369
Your Inbox holds the questions agents are waiting on you to answer.

00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:06.214
This one is the Planner's.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.503
Pick an option, and give your reason in a note.

00:00:10.364 --> 00:00:11.415
Unclear?

00:00:11.415 --> 00:00:12.598
Ask back.

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:15.442
Answered, it leaves your Inbox.

00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:18.330
Open in document shows where your answer landed.

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:19.140
Open it there.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:24.452
The decision block keeps the option you picked,

00:00:24.635 --> 00:00:25.421
your reason,

00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:26.426
and who answered.
